I stroke slowly. Watching the reflection in the dark monitor. EthX-chan touching herself. The wig falls across my cheek. My lip tinted mouth opens slightly. The image in the dark screen is a girl with her hand under her skirt and her eyes half closed and her breath coming in short quiet pulses.

I think about the chat. Five thousand voices calling me cute, pretty, good girl. The words loop in my skull like a song I can't stop hearing.

//"Good girl."//

I come hard. My back arches against the chair. The orgasm rolls through me like a train, heavier and longer than anything I've felt in months, charged with something beyond friction. Shame and excitement braided together so tight I can't tell which is which. The ghost of five thousand people calling me pretty is in the room. They're watching. They can't see me but they're watching and I'm performing even now, alone, in the dark, coming into my own fist with a wig on.

The orgasm fades. I soften. My fingers are a mess. I sit there. The wig itches. The makeup feels tight on my face. My phone buzzes on the desk. Another notification. Another stranger who followed the girl in the skirt.

I don't clean up right away. I sit in it. The wet boxers against my skin. The skirt over my thighs. The wig on my head.

Something happened tonight. Not just the stream. Something underneath the stream. I don't have the language for it and I don't want to find it.

