:: R5-Choice-C [release5]
<<set $feminization += 10>>
<<set $viewers += 50>>
<<set $chatMood to "devoted">>
<<set $r5AloneChoice to "secondStream">>
I go back live at midnight. Title, "Bonus round, chat. EthX-chan after dark."

Twelve hundred viewers at midnight. Not five thousand, smaller. But the energy is different. These are the ones who stayed. The devoted. The ones who want more and came back and are sitting in the dark at their own desks watching me in the dark at mine.

The second stream is looser. I'm tired and wired and the adrenaline has been replaced by something softer, more reckless. I lean into the persona. I use chat's language. I call them babies and do a peace sign and the chat erupts. I play badly and don't care. I read donations in a slightly higher voice and nobody asks me to stop.

