That last comment. Become herself. Three words from a stranger at midnight. I read it on stream and my breath catches and I move on too quickly and the moment passes but the words don't.

<<set $donationsTonight += 200>>

Two hundred more in donations. A thousand forty seven total for the night. More than double my best month. In a pink wig.

I end the stream at 2 AM. I am very tired and very awake.

